51
00:02:56,474 --> 00:02:59,254
Yeah, I smoked - not to run, just to pause,

52
00:02:59,794 --> 00:03:01,714
Watched the smoke like a basic law.

53
00:03:02,194 --> 00:03:04,414
Life ain’t speed, ain’t outer sound,

54
00:03:04,474 --> 00:03:07,114
It’s the inner light - that’s how I’m bound.

55
00:03:07,274 --> 00:03:09,895
I returned - not to crowds, but to me,

56
00:03:10,435 --> 00:03:12,075
Not for fame, but for clarity.

57
00:03:13,095 --> 00:03:15,015
Pain is gone, but it left me sense,

58
00:03:15,275 --> 00:03:17,775
I’m alive - and that’s the recompense.

59
00:03:18,335 --> 00:03:20,435
You stopped chasing. You learned to stand.

60
00:03:20,455 --> 00:03:23,196
You endured, understood, forgave, unplanned.

61
00:03:23,236 --> 00:03:25,916
And in that calm, no trophies, no fight,

62
00:03:25,936 --> 00:03:28,536
You finally felt it — life has light.

